# Generated build artifacts
# TI-99:  cvbasic -> xas99 -> linkticart
BUSTABOB.a99
*.bin
*.txt
# ColecoVision:  cvbasic -> gasm80
*.asm
*.rom
*.lst
*.sym

# The .log is the compiler transcript build-ti.sh greps to prove which level set
# it compiled -- see the #info guard there.
*.log

# NOTE: art.bas, levels.bas and levels2.bas ARE tracked. They are generated (by
# assets/genart.py and assets/genlevels.py) but are build INPUTS, the same way
# RALLY-X tracks its generated map2_*.bas -- the build must work from a clean
# checkout without running the generators. levels2.bas is the EXPERT set, picked
# by `build-ti.sh --expert`.
